lavender: time of day from the PM660 RTC; lv:time from the host

- SweetPlatformExpert get/setGMTTimeOfDay: PM660 RTC (0x6000) through the SPMI code in sweet_usb.c
- sweet_usb.c: SPMI channel mappings cached; USB command "lv:time SECS" sets the calendar (and the RTC)
- made by xnu/src/mk_rtc.py

